{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39546","headline":"送薛郎中赴江州 · 张蠙","name":"送薛郎中赴江州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几州闻出刺，谣美有江民。\n正面传天旨，悬心祷岳神。\n尺书先假路，红斾旋烧尘。\n郡显山川别，衙开将吏新。\n散招僧坐暑，闲载客行春。\n听事棊忘着，探题酒乱巡。\n好编高隐传，多貌上昇真。\n近日居清近，求人在此人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张蠙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}